OL,3,AHow Westside Cowboy went from student  
OL,4,Agigs to rising stars in two years      
OL,6,FIn two years, Westside Cowboy have     
OL,7,Frocketed from the sweaty corners of    
OL,8,FManchester's student pub circuit to    
OL,9,Fperformances on one of America's       
OL,10,Fbiggest talk shows and at many of the  
OL,11,FUK's biggest festivals.                
OL,13,FWhat started as jamming for fun in a   
OL,14,Fstudent bedroom has become the latest  
OL,15,Frevolution in British indie known as   
OL,16,F"Britainicana".                        
OL,18,FNow the quartet have been named the BBC
OL,19,FIntroducing Artist of the Year for     
OL,20,F2026.                                  
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
